OL,5,G1200 World Series of Darts Finals
OL,6,     FIt's day three of the World Series
OL,7,     Fof Darts Finals at AFAS Live in
OL,8,     FAmsterdam as four second-round
OL,9,     Fclashes take place. Gabby
OL,10,     FPartington, Glen Durrant and Chris
OL,11,     FMason host.
OL,12,G1600 Junk and Disorderly
OL,13,     FHenry Cole, Allen Millyard and Guy
OL,14,     FWillison revamp their stall after
OL,15,     Fpicking up a vanload of trinkets
OL,16,     Fand set their sights on a big sale
OL,17,     Fat a mega jumble held by Sammy
OL,18,     FMiller.
